{"seq":3,"slug":"ph-hn-launch-playbook","title":"Product Hunt 与 Hacker News 启动","stage":"DONE","category":"indie-app-shipping","categoryLabel":"独立开发与上架","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook","rating":{"composite":3.53,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Product Hunt 与 Hacker News 启动 简介\n\nProduct Hunt 和 Hacker News 是独立开发者最常用的两个发布渠道，用好它们能在一天内集中触达一批早期采用者与技术受众。本 hub 面向要在这两个平台发布产品的独立开发者，从 Product Hunt 机制（基础、发布准备、发布当天）讲起，覆盖 Hacker News（Show HN 什么有效、标题与评论、避免被 flag 与反噬）、发布素材（标语、演示视觉、面向发布的落地页），以及预期与跟进（峰值 vs 持续、找对受众、发布后跟进）。贯穿全篇的诚实主线是：这两个渠道都尊重真实、反营销，靠真诚的呈现和可动员的真实受众取胜；它们带来的是一次性流量峰值而非持续增长，价值在于把峰值流量沉淀为资产、启动持续引擎——而发布的真正成败，取决于受众是否契合，以及发布之后踏实的跟进。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"product-hunt","title":"Product Hunt","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/product-hunt","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ph-fundamentals","title":"Product Hunt 基础","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/product-hunt/ph-fundamentals","wordCount":1743,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"ph-launch-preparation","title":"Product Hunt 发布准备","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/product-hunt/ph-launch-preparation","wordCount":1742,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"ph-launch-day","title":"Product Hunt 发布当天","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/product-hunt/ph-launch-day","wordCount":1805,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲 Product Hunt：每日投票排名榜的基础机制与受众契合度、发布前的素材/时机/受众预热准备（七分准备三分当天）、以及发布当天点燃早期势头、全天真诚互动、把流量转化为留存的运作。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hacker-news","title":"Hacker News","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/hacker-news","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"show-hn-what-works","title":"Show HN：什么有效","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/hacker-news/show-hn-what-works","wordCount":1750,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"hn-titles-and-comments","title":"HN 标题与评论参与","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/hacker-news/hn-titles-and-comments","wordCount":1781,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"avoiding-flag-and-backlash","title":"避免被 flag 与反噬","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/hacker-news/avoiding-flag-and-backlash","wordCount":1799,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲 Hacker News：极挑剔反营销的技术社区里 Show HN 什么有效（真实有料、谦逊真诚）、朴实准确的标题与作为价值核心的评论参与，以及如何靠尊重 HN 文化避免被 flag 与社区反噬。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"launch-assets","title":"Launch Assets","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/launch-assets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tagline-and-pitch","title":"标语与一句话推介","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/launch-assets/tagline-and-pitch","wordCount":1624,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"demo-and-visuals","title":"演示与视觉素材","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/launch-assets/demo-and-visuals","wordCount":1702,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"landing-page-for-launch","title":"面向发布的落地页","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/launch-assets/landing-page-for-launch","wordCount":1833,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲发布素材：一句话说清价值并按渠道适配语气的标语、几秒内证明产品有用好用的演示与视觉（GIF/视频/可试 demo），以及承接发布流量、决定转化的面向发布的落地页。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"expectations-and-followthrough","title":"Expectations And Followthrough","docCount":3,"url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/expectations-and-followthrough","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spikes-vs-sustained","title":"峰值与持续增长","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/expectations-and-followthrough/spikes-vs-sustained","wordCount":1816,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"right-fit-audiences","title":"找对受众","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/expectations-and-followthrough/right-fit-audiences","wordCount":1826,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"post-launch-followthrough","title":"发布后的跟进","url":"/h/indie-app-shipping/ph-hn-launch-playbook/expectations-and-followthrough/post-launch-followthrough","wordCount":1825,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲预期与跟进：发布带来的是一次性峰值而非持续增长（价值在沉淀资产、点燃持续引擎）、发布渠道价值取决于受众是否契合你的目标用户、以及把短暂发布事件编织进长期增长的发布后跟进。\n"}]}